{"id":179,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Rubbing its fleece generates electricity. You’ll want to pet it because it’s cute, but if you use your bare hand, you’ll get a painful shock."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Clothing made from Mareep’s fleece is easily charged with static electricity, so a special process is used on it."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby"],"text":"Mareep’s fluffy coat of wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more static electricity is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail glows."},{"games":["Y","Crystal"],"text":"It stores lots of air in its soft fur, allowing it to stay cool in summer and warm in winter."},{"games":["X","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"When cold weather increases static electricity, its wool doubles in size and the tip of its tail glows slightly."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"Its fleece grows continually. In the summer, the fleece is fully shed, but it grows back in a week."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"If static electricity builds in its body, its fleece doubles in volume. Touching it will shock you."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its fluffy wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more energy is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail glows."},{"games":["Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"MAREEP’s fluffy coat of wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more static electricity is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail grows."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Static","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is charged with static electricity and may paralyze attackers that make direct contact with it."},{"name":"Plus","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Sp. Atk stat of the Pokémon if an ally with the Plus or Minus Ability is also in battle."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"White","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":179,"name":"Mareep","condition":null,"children":[{"id":180,"name":"Flaaffy","condition":"Lv. 15","children":[{"id":181,"name":"Ampharos","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,45],[4,86],[8,84],[11,178],[15,268],[18,36],[22,486],[25,109],[29,408],[32,435],[36,538],[39,605],[43,113],[46,87]],"machine":[97,34,268,451,109,605,91,38,598,604,486,527,283,203,263,270,113,408,182,240,115,156,214,164,241,36,851,87,86,85,885,521,528],"egg":[495,97,598,604,527,260],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me4-27","name":"Mareep","set":"Chaos Rising","date":"2026-05-22","rarity":"Common","number":"27","artist":"UKUMO viti","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-27/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-27/large"},{"id":"sv10-72","name":"Team Rocket's Mareep","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Common","number":"72","artist":null,"img":"sv10/72"},{"id":"sv1-66","name":"Mareep","set":"Scarlet & Violet","date":"2023-03-31","rarity":"Common","number":"66","artist":"Narumi Sato","img":"sv1/66"},{"id":"swsh12pt5gg-GG34","name":"Mareep","set":"Crown Zenith Galarian Gallery","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Trainer Gallery Rare Holo","number":"GG34","artist":"Kouki Saitou","img":"swsh12pt5gg/GG34"},{"id":"svp-107","name":"Mareep","set":"Scarlet & Violet Black Star Promos","date":"2023-01-01","rarity":"Promo","number":"107","artist":"Orca","img":"svp/107"},{"id":"swsh7-54","name":"Mareep","set":"Evolving Skies","date":"2021-08-27","rarity":"Common","number":"54","artist":"Yukiko Baba","img":"swsh7/54"},{"id":"swsh6-47","name":"Mareep","set":"Chilling Reign","date":"2021-06-18","rarity":"Common","number":"47","artist":"Miki Tanaka","img":"swsh6/47"},{"id":"swsh3-55","name":"Mareep","set":"Dark